  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Defense Systems and Solutions obligated $341M in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Defense Systems and Solutions received 274 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $1.2M. Defense Systems and Solutions obligations are down 49.3% year over year. Defense Systems and Solutions recorded a multi-year pattern before FY26: FY21 obligations were $323M, FY22 obligations were $269M, FY23 obligations were $456M, FY24 obligations were $547M, and FY25 obligations were $673M. Defense Systems and Solutions current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity. Defense Systems and Solutions figures reported here are contract obligations except where award-value figures appear in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Defense Systems and Solutions award activity shows lower total obligations in FY26 compared with the prior fiscal year while average award size remains at $1.2M. Defense Systems and Solutions history shows rising obligations through FY25 followed by the FY26 decline to date.",
